  "caption": "Six residual blocks over three resolutions; every shape is channels × height × width. The first block is drawn open, so the shortcut is an edge a reader can follow: the branch computes, the input arrives unchanged along the dashed line, and the two are summed. Every later block closes the same way inside one box. Where the map halves and the width doubles the shortcut cannot be an identity and becomes a strided pointwise convolution — the only residual path the trace records separately, and the reason those two have a box of their own."
